  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3302.26 “State label” means the New Hampshire seal or insignia issued by the department and attached to an approved modular building.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
